          "docs": {
            "tags": [],
            "text": "Soft fallback location (label or ZIP) shown when NOTHING is in the shared\n`hub:location` store. It is display-only: it is NOT written to localStorage\nand does NOT emit `popLocationChange`, so the user can still actively set a\nreal location (which then wins + persists) and we never clobber a server zip.\nPrecedence for what's shown: stored `hub:location` → `default` → \"Set Location\"."
          },
